.TH GNOMILESTONE 1 "" "gnomilestone @VERSION@"
.SH NAME
gnomilestone \- desktop project manager with Gantt chart and GitHub integration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gnomilestone
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gnomilestone
is a GTK application to manage projects, tasks and subtasks with an
interactive Gantt chart, a task list and a Kanban board, with optional
linking to GitHub Issues and Projects.
.PP
It opens the graphical interface. Standard GTK and GApplication options are accepted;
the application has no commands of its own.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/gnomilestone/settings.json
User settings (language and theme).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANGUAGE
Interface language when it is set to \(lqSystem\(rq in the preferences.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project page: https://github.com/seguidodoblado/gnomilestone
.SH AUTHOR
Jose Antonio Seguido Doblado <jose.antonio.seguido@gmail.com>
